                          "fill": "$H:--muted-foreground",
                          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                          "width": "fill_container",
                          "content": "An in-pod agent sidecar streams the console over WebSocket and speaks each game's native protocol — Source RCON, telnet, Rust WebRcon, BattlEye, or a REST admin API — no SSH, no kubectl exec, no separate client required.",
